sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant API as FastAPI Gateway
    participant Policy as Prompt Policy
    participant LLM as Ollama / Gemma 4
    participant Gate as Tool Validator
    participant OAuth as ORDS OAuth
    participant ORDS as ORDS REST API
    participant PL as AI_GATEWAY_API
    participant DB as Oracle Demo Schema
    participant Audit as SQLite Audit Store

    User->>API: POST /v1/agent/chat (X-API-Key)
    API->>Policy: Inspect prompt; detect patterns
    Policy->>Audit: agent.requested / blocked event
    alt Sensitive data + block policy
        Policy-->>User: HTTP 403; no LLM or ORDS request
    else Redact or no findings
        Policy->>LLM: Sanitized prompt + fixed tool definitions
        LLM-->>API: Native tool call (name + JSON arguments)
        API->>Gate: Validate allowlisted tool + arguments
        Gate->>Audit: agent.tool.requested
        API->>OAuth: POST /oauth/token (client credentials)
        OAuth-->>API: Bearer token (cached in process)
        API->>ORDS: Approved endpoint + Bearer token
        alt list_departments
            ORDS->>DB: Fixed read-only collection query
            DB-->>ORDS: Synthetic department rows
        else department_summary
            ORDS->>PL: Invoke approved PL/SQL procedure
            PL->>DB: SELECT one approved department
            DB-->>PL: Department values
            PL->>DB: Write AI_GATEWAY_AUDIT row with request ID
            PL-->>ORDS: Summary JSON
        end
        ORDS-->>API: JSON tool result
        API->>Audit: agent.tool.succeeded (result digest)
        API->>LLM: Tool result; tools disabled on final turn
        LLM-->>API: Natural-language answer
        API->>Audit: agent.completed
        API-->>User: Answer + structured source data + request ID
    end
